# iOS simulator libraries — every entry here is a machine-specific symlink and
# none of it belongs in git.
#
# Most point into a sibling jami-client-ios checkout's xcframework/ build output;
# libJamiBridge_iossim.a points back at the real, tracked copy in ../lib/. So
# unlike ../lib/.gitignore, there is no exception to make here — do not add one.
#
# Regenerate with: python3 scripts/make_sim_links.py
# See ../JamiBridge/README.md for the full setup.
*
!.gitignore
